    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A delightful two bedroom mid terrace red brick house situated on The Coombe within walking distance of Grafton Street and a range of amenities.  The property is presented in good condition ready for the new owner to put their stamp on it.  Viewing is a must!\r\n\r\nOnce through the door you enter a small porch which opens to the living room.  This room has a high ceiling and is a bright room with a fireplace and timber flooring.  The living room leads to a well equipped kitchen.  The kitchen has a door to a small yard to the rear.  Off the kitchen is a bathroom.  Upstairs there are two bedrooms.  The master bedroom is to the front and spans the width of the house.  The second bedroom is to the rear.  Both have built-in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nThe Coombe lies at the heart of Dublin 8. The area has a strong community at its centre and is steeped in local history. Dublin 8 is a part of the city where old meets new and the result is a lively and diverse mix. The highly convenient location is within walking distance of Christchurch, Temple Bar and Grafton Street. The area is a food lovers delight with great coffee shops, a choice of restaurants and an eclectic range of food stores. Social amenities include Vicar Street and other late night venues. The historic attractions available in the vicinity are the Guinness Storehouse, Christchurch Cathedral and Dublin Castle. The area is well served by Dublin Bus and the Luas green line is within walking distance."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance porch     1.47m x 1.44m\r\nTimber flooring. Door to \r\n\r\nLiving room     4.01 x 3.83\r\nTimber flooring. Fireplace.  \r\n\r\nKitchen     3.46m x 1.75m\r\nLinoleum flooring. Range of wall and floor units. Plumbing for washing machine. Door to rear yard.\r\n\r\nBathroom     2.17m x 1.96m\r\nTiled floor. Part tiled walls. WC. Wash hand basin. Shower enclosure.\r\n\r\nUpstairs\r\n\r\nMaster bedroom     3.45m x 3.01m\r\nCarpet flooring. Built-in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2     2.98m x 2.31m\r\nCarpet flooring. Built-in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nOutside\r\nYard"
      },
      {
