        "Content": "2 Bedroom mid terrace house\r\nDouble glazed windows\r\nGas fired central heating \r\nFloor area approximately 58sqm/624sqft\r\nOn street resident permit car parking\r\nA short walk to Grafton Street, Christchurch and Temple Bar\r\nServed by numerous bus routes\r\nWithin walking distance of the Luas"
